            Intro: :  the intro is a variation of the Em7 chord but look for the 3rd variation
of Em7 to play. Use fingers 2 & 3 to hold down the top 2 strings,  this will leave you
1st finger to move up to the 2nd chord, and then use your pinky to hit the 3rd chord;
which is just a quick on and then off. Your 2&3 finger stay in place the whole time.
or if that seems too hard just play a normal Em7 the whole time.

